            <description><![CDATA[<h2>QuietSpeech 0.3.4</h2>
<ul>
<li>Choose double-tapping the Hold to Talk key or a separate shortcut for Tap to Toggle. Double-tap to start hands-free dictation and tap once to stop.</li>
<li>Fix saving modifier-key shortcuts and improve function-key selection.</li>
<li>Fix startup freezes caused by macOS spell-checking.</li>
<li>Prevent overlapping startups and late microphone starts after releasing the shortcut.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
